Probably not in full. Under the current terms (version terms-2026-04), a car booking cancelled less than 48 hours before departure is refunded at 50 per cent. A cancellation at least 48 hours before departure gets a full refund.

So cancelling the day before sailing would normally mean a 50% refund. If you change the sailing instead of cancelling, that's free up to 24 hours before departure, so changing could be an option if your plans allow it.
